    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin displays Forex market sessions on your WordPress site.<br />\n&#8211; Select broker and user timezone<br />\n&#8211; Highlight the active session<br />\n&#8211; Drag the red line to check different times<br />\n&#8211; Responsive design for desktop and mobile</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to <code>wp-content/plugins/</code>.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin via the WordPress admin panel.</li>\n<li>Use shortcode <code>[forex_sessions]</code> in any post or page.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='is%20it%20responsive%3F'>\nIs it responsive?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it works on desktop and mobile devices.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='how%20to%20change%20the%20default%20timezone%3F'>\nHow to change the default timezone?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Use the dropdowns above the sessions timeline.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Display Forex market sessions with broker and user timezone selection and active session highlight.",
